ector":-0.0052,"r5_sector":-0.1088,"etf":"XLK"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"DOCN 2024 Q4","e":"docn","d":"2025-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paddy Srinivasan","x":"And finally, we doubled down on our heritage of being the most approachable public cloud provider by continuing to invest in support of open-source AI models and even hosting our developer conference deploy in January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/25/digitalocean-docn-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2024 Q4","e":"docn","d":"2025-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paddy Srinivasan","x":"Our prudent approach to AI investments also allows us to ramp investment where we see customer demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/25/digitalocean-docn-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2024 Q4","e":"docn","d":"2025-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paddy Srinivasan","x":"Through our customer-facing teams, we were able to fully migrate their workloads to DigitalOcean, leveraging our optimized database infrastructure to improve their performance while providing them with substantial cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/25/digitalocean-docn-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2025 Q3","e":"docn","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"I will start with our AI infrastructure on the bottom right, which is a full-stack inference platform targeting AI native customers that have their own models that they want to tune, optimize and run in inference mode.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/digitalocean-docn-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2025 Q3","e":"docn","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"Our AI infrastructure provides comprehensive hardware plus software infrastructure for AI-native companies that are scaling up real-world inference workloads globally on DO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/digitalocean-docn-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2025 Q3","e":"docn","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Steinfort","x":"…our higher spending AI and digital native enterprises, coupled with the increased visibility we have from having signed multiple 8-figure committed contracts after Q3 close, gives us the confidence to raise our outlook on both revenue and adjusted free cash flow margin for both 2025 and 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/digitalocean-docn-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2025 Q4","e":"docn","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan T. Srinivasan","x":"These AI natives need more than just GPU rentals or inference APIs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/digitalocean-docn-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2025 Q4","e":"docn","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan T. Srinivasan","x":"We delivered 100% throughput increase and roughly 50% lower cost per token for Character.AI on our production inference cloud powered by AMD Instinct GPUs at production scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/digitalocean-docn-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2025 Q4","e":"docn","d":"2026-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"James Edward Fish","x":"So I guess, how are you thinking about what commitments you actually have from them and potential pass-through of memory costs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/digitalocean-docn-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2025 Q4","e":"docn","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan T. Srinivasan","x":"Software is being disrupted, not by incremental AI features, but by a structural shift to agentic systems operating at scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/digitalocean-docn-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2025 Q4","e":"docn","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan T. Srinivasan","x":"Cloud and AI-native disruptors are moving beyond AI experimentation at a breakneck speed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/digitalocean-docn-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q1","e":"docn","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"We operate a global scale infrastructure with 20 data centers purpose built for AI workloads running a full stack core computing platform with a complete set of computing primitive that Agentic workloads demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/digitalocean-docn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q1","e":"docn","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"AI infrastructure is a material cost of revenue line item for these AI natives, especially when they scale, maintaining flexibility across models and platforms and leveraging the most efficient model capabilities for every specific task is an existential requirement for them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/digitalocean-docn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q1","e":"docn","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Steinfort","x":"For the full year 2026, we are again meaningfully raising our outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/digitalocean-docn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q1","e":"docn","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"And as I said, to Gabriela's question, that ability and our ability to execute that is part of the reason why we're able to raise the guidance for this year without getting any benefit from the incremental capacity that we just announced.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/digitalocean-docn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q2","e":"docn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"An integrated full stack platform is foundational to AI builders because AI native applications require far more than raw GPUs or just tokens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/digitalocean-docn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q2","e":"docn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"It is worth pausing on how different our profile is from many others in the AI infrastructure market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/digitalocean-docn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q2","e":"docn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"With this momentum continuing to build, we are again raising our 2026 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/digitalocean-docn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q2","e":"docn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"Our momentum and solid execution enables us to raise our 2026 outlook and positions us for strong performance in 2027.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/digitalocean-docn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q3","e":"docn","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"The guidance beat came from rapidly growing inference services, more core cloud attached to AI workloads, strong utilization of our Elastic Compute fleet, higher prices on short-term capacity and early agentic adoption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/digitalocean-docn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q3","e":"docn","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"Finally, as we just saw, AI customers are pulling through higher-margin compute, data and other platform primitives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/digitalocean-docn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q3","e":"docn","d":"2026-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"All of this together is why we are raising our outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/digitalocean-docn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCN 2026 Q3","e":"docn","d":"2026-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Padmanabhan Srinivasan","x":"With momentum continuing to grow, we are again raising our outlook for both 2026 and 2027.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/digitalocean-docn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[60,1,9357,0,0,0,8334,669],[63,1,8311,0,0,0,7338,514],[64,1,14144,0,0,0,11580,1914],[65,1,9522,0,0,0,7968,1293],[66,1,8472,0,0,0,7024,1175],[67,1,8658,0,0,0,7099,1171]],"cinema":[[60,1,9357,0,0,0,8334,669],[63,1,8311,0,0,0,7338,514],[64,1,14144,0,0,0,11580,1914],[65,1,9522,0,0,0,7968,1293],[66,1,8472,0,0,0,7024,1175],[67,1,8658,0,0,0,7099,1171]],"imax":[[60,1,9357,0,0,0,8334,669],[63,1,8311,0,0,0,7338,514],[64,1,14144,0,0,0,11580,1914],[65,1,9522,0,0,0,7968,1293],[66,1,8472,0,0,0,7024,1175],[67,1,8658,0,0,0,7099,1171]],"streaming":[[60,1,9357,0,0,0,8334,669],[63,1,8311,0,0,0,7338,514],[64,1,14144,0,0,0,11580,1914],[65,1,9522,0,0,0,7968,1293],[66,1,8472,0,0,0,7024,1175],[67,1,8658,0,0,0,7099,1171]],"dtc":[[60,1,9357,0,0,0,8334,669],[63,1,8311,0,0,0,7338,514],[64,1,14144,0,0,0,11580,1914],[65,1,9522,0,0,0,7968,1293],[66,1,8472,0,0,0,7024,1175],[67,1,8658,0,0,0,7099,1171]],"ai_spend":[[60,1,9357,14,14,0,8334,669],[63,1,8311,14,14,0,7338,514],[64,1,14144,13,10,3,11580,1914],[65,1,9522,9,9,0,7968,1293],[66,1,8472,4,4,0,7024,1175],[67,1,8658,3,3,0,